OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours in different councils
OL,4,Aafter shake-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeighbours with only a hedge between
OL,7,Fthem will be in different council areas
OL,8,Fafter a reorganisation of local
OL,9,Fgovernment in Devon.
OL,11,FRoberta Ayles and Ethan Merrington-Pink
OL,12,Flive next door to one another in Totnes
OL,13,Fbut are on opposite sides of the
OL,14,Fplanned boundary between the new Devon
OL,15,FCouncil and the Torbay and South Devon
OL,16,FCouncil.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
