OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours in different councils
OL,4,Aafter shake-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey say the plan is ridiculous and
OL,7,Fwill have an impact on issues like the
OL,8,Fchoice of schools and bin collections.
OL,9,FTheir concerns are backed by other
OL,10,Fresidents, councillors and the town's
OL,11,FMP.
OL,13,FBut the government - which will make
OL,14,Fthe final decision - has said it wants
OL,15,Fthe boundary drawn along parish council
OL,16,Flines.
